        <title>如何将Windows的网络代理共享给VMware虚拟机</title>
        <link>http://101.200.73.250:80/p/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%B0%86windows%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%BB%99vmware%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E6%9C%BA/</link>
        <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        
        <guid>http://101.200.73.250:80/p/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%B0%86windows%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%BB%99vmware%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E6%9C%BA/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724093853445.png" alt="Featured image of post 如何将Windows的网络代理共享给VMware虚拟机" /&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;如何将windows的网络代理共享给vmware虚拟机&#34;&gt;如何将Windows的网络代理共享给VMware虚拟机
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vmware网络适配器选择NAT模式
&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724092637633.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20240724092637633&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cmd输入ipconfig，找到VMnet8，记录下IPv4地址
&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724092837876.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20240724092837876&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;打开主机网络代理软件，打开允许LAN，记录程序端口
&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724093021038.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20240724093021038&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;打开ubuntu网络设置，网络代理选择手动，在http和https后填入VWnet8的IPv4和代理程序端口
&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724093356163.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20240724093356163&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;打开控制面板，进入网络适配器设置，找到主机WLAN网络
&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724093618511.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20240724093618511&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;在WLAN属性中将internet连接共享给VMnet8
&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724093853445.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20240724093853445&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;检查虚拟机网络是否可用&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;如果不可用，尝试关闭ubuntu防火墙&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;任然不可用，修改主机防火墙入站规则
&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724094540511.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;image-20240724094540511&#34;
	
	
&gt;
在入站规则中将带有（专用）标注的规则修改为与普通规则一致&lt;img src=&#34;https://typora-picturelib.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image-20240724094710437.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;image-20240724094710437&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
